<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Contact Form Submission</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">We Received Your Message</h1>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for contacting us! We've received your message and will get back to you shortly.</p>
    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <p><strong>Subject:</strong> {{subject}}</p>
      <p><strong>Message:</strong></p>
      <p>{{message}}</p>
    </div>
    <p>Our team typically responds within 24-48 hours.</p>
    <p>Best,<br>The KKIT Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
